 SG_ CRC8 : 48|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" ARDUINO_PRIMARY
 SG_ Counter : 56|4@1+ (1,0) [0|15] "" ARDUINO_PRIMARY
 SG_ KinFlags : 60|4@1+ (1,0) [0|15] "" ARDUINO_PRIMARY

BO_ 400 Plan_Control_Status: 8 JETSON_ORIN
